# Short 2, "Eight pieces" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): the eight pieces, three bars each, the
# PRESETS knob turned one step on each change's downbeat (Basic, Chamber, Steppers, Fog, Concrete, Night Drive,
# Pressure, Haze), then Haze played on. Each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for the labels).
bar 8
wav 11-short-pieces.wav
film 11-short-pieces.film
bar 8 BASIC (F Dorian, 122)
bar 11 CHAMBER (A Aeolian, 118)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 1
bar 14 STEPPERS (D Dorian, 126)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 2
bar 17 FOG (G Aeolian, 112)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 3
bar 20 CONCRETE (C pentatonic minor, 130)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 4
bar 23 NIGHT DRIVE (Bb Dorian, 124)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 5
bar 26 PRESSURE (E Phrygian, 128)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 6
bar 29 HAZE (Eb Ionian, 116)
turn PRESET 1 5
expect piece 7
bar 33 END
filmstop
wavstop
